OL,3,AKing makes clear Harry and Meghan
OL,4,Aremain non-working royals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex will not
OL,7,Fbe working royals carrying out official
OL,8,Fengagements now they have returned to
OL,9,Fthe UK, a letter sent on behalf of King
OL,10,FCharles says.
OL,12,FThe letter is intended to clarify the
OL,13,Fstatus of Prince Harry and Meghan, who
OL,14,Fmoved back from California with
OL,15,Fchildren Archie and Lilibet last month.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
