OL,3,AKing makes clear Harry and Meghan
OL,4,Aremain non-working royals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will still not be able to use the
OL,7,F"HRH" titles of His and Her Royal
OL,8,FHighness, and are "private citizens
OL,9,Fwith commercial and charitable
OL,10,Finterests", the letter sent on behalf
OL,11,Fof the King by the Lord Chamberlain, a
OL,12,Ftop Palace official, says.
OL,14,FIt has been sent to Prince Harry's team
OL,15,Fand to the government, military and
OL,16,FLord Lieutenants, according to Palace
OL,17,Fsources.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
